      "homePageType": "html",
      "homePageValue": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>FIFA Analytics</title>\n    <style>\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #0a1f12; color: #e8e8e8; line-height: 1.6; }\n        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a1a0d 0%, #1a4d2e 60%, #0d2818 100%); padding: 40px 60px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-bottom: 3px solid #c9a84c; }\n        .header img { height: 72px; width: auto; }\n        .header-text h1 { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800; color: #c9a84c; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }\n        .header-text p { font-size: 15px; color: #a0c8b0; margin-top: 4px; }\n        .welcome { padding: 40px 60px 20px; max-width: 900px; }\n        .welcome h2 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: #c9a84c; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n        .welcome p { font-size: 15px; color: #b0c8b8; line-height: 1.7; }\n        .kpi-section { padding: 20px 60px 30px; }\n        .kpi-section h3 { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #6a9a7a; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n        .kpi-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; max-width: 960px; }\n        .kpi-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d2818 0%, #1a3d26 100%); border: 1px solid #2a5a3a; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px; }\n        .kpi-card .label { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.07em; color: #7ab090; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n        .kpi-card .value { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 700; color: #c9a84c; }\n        .kpi-card .sub { font-size: 12px; color: #6a9a7a; margin-top: 4px; }\n        .stats-strip { background: #0d2818; border-top: 1px solid #2a5a3a; border-bottom: 1px solid #2a5a3a; padding: 16px 60px; display: flex; gap: 40px; margin: 10px 0; }\n        .stat-item { text-align: center; }\n        .stat-item .s-val { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; }\n        .stat-item .s-lbl { font-size: 11px; color: #7ab090; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }\n        .footer { padding: 24px 60px; background: #060f09; border-top: 1px solid #1a3d26; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }\n        .footer span { font-size: 12px; color: #4a7a5a; }\n        .footer .brand { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #c9a84c; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <div class=\"header-text\">\n            <h1>FIFA Analytics</h1>\n            <p>Global Football Intelligence &mdash; Powered by ThoughtSpot</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"welcome\">\n        <h2>Welcome to FIFA Analytics</h2>\n        <p>The first game of international football under standard modern rules took place on November 30, 1872. Today, the beautiful game generates more data than ever. Explore match results, goal patterns, home vs. away performance, and team statistics&mdash;all through the power of agentic analytics. Ask Hugo a question or dive into the dashboard below.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"kpi-section\">\n        <h3>Key Performance Indicators</h3>\n        <div class=\"kpi-grid\">\n            <div class=\"kpi-card\">\n                <div class=\"label\">Total Matches</div>\n                <div class=\"value\">45,415</div>\n                <div class=\"sub\">Across all international competitions</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-card\">\n                <div class=\"label\">Goals Scored</div>\n                <div class=\"value\">133,852</div>\n                <div class=\"sub\">Avg 2.95 goals per match</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-card\">\n                <div class=\"label\">Home Win Rate</div>\n                <div class=\"value\">47.3%</div>\n                <div class=\"sub\">vs. 27.1% away wins</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-card\">\n                <div class=\"label\">Clean Sheets</div>\n                <div class=\"value\">12,840</div>\n                <div class=\"sub\">28.2% of all matches</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-card\">\n                <div class=\"label\">Nations Represented</div>\n                <div class=\"value\">211</div>\n                <div class=\"sub\">FIFA member associations</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"kpi-card\">\n                <div class=\"label\">Top Tournament</div>\n                <div class=\"value\">World Cup</div>\n                <div class=\"sub\">Most watched sporting event globally</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stats-strip\">\n        <div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"s-val\">1872</div><div class=\"s-lbl\">First Match Year</div></div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"s-val\">150+</div><div class=\"s-lbl\">Years of Data</div></div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"s-val\">3.6B</div><div class=\"s-lbl\">Global Fans</div></div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"s-val\">32</div><div class=\"s-lbl\">World Cup Teams</div></div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"s-val\">64</div><div class=\"s-lbl\">World Cup Matches</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        <span>&copy; 2025 FIFA Analytics &mdash; Powered by ThoughtSpot</span>\n        <span class=\"brand\">FIFA Analytics</span>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
